{"availability":"available","full":"fathom-lab/styxx","name":"styxx","description":"Verification for the agent era. Your coding agent's PR summary cannot lie about its diff - one CI line. Plus the research: the first map of which AI minds can read each other. Every claim machine-verified against committed receipts, negatives included. pip install styxx","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":15,"forks":2,"created":"2026-04-13T17:03:39Z","updated":"2026-10-13T14:59:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://styxx-org.netlify.app","topics":["agent-tools","ai-agents","ai-safety","ci","code-review","github-action","hallucination-detection","interpretability","llm","preregistration","reproducible-research","verification"],"demo":"https://styxx-org.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:50.105Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:50.105Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:50.105Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:00.793Z","stars":15,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:05:50.105Z","stars":15,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["styxx is a verification layer for the agent era. Every instrument in it is built on a single principle, and the principle is the product:","An instrument that cannot refuse cannot be trusted. Each one names what stopped it, and none of them will tell you more than the evidence carries.","They compose. A sense channel is scored by coupling, whose verdict is written into a finding, whose every number is checked by certify, whose preregistration is enforced by protocol, and the whole thing is sealed or refused. That chain is why a claim from this repo can be checked by a stranger from committed bytes, within the verifier's measured limits (the OATH row below states them)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fathom-lab/styxx/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"348fd8640875e9684dded42a355adb5cd3e79d2cbe80a067cea8f9